{"1467590": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Frontiers Reach", "steam_appid": 1467590, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Take control of a powerful starfighter and enter a conflict stretching across the frontier. Tackle story missions, side operations, and high-stakes combat scenarios as you battle enemy forces, support the war effort, and adapt your ship to each mission. With customizable loadouts and fast-paced space battles that change the shape of the conflict, every mission gives you another chance to prove yourself among the stars.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1467590/extras/31b02bc8b2b32add7aff2c80abc236d3.avif?t=1780047455\" width=600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An epic story of survival in an interstellar war</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is the year 2230. After nearly 100 years of expansion and colonization in space, the human species now stands on the brink of war. On one side is the corrupt and aging Sol Confederacy. On the other is the fledgling, Frontier Republic. <br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Neither one is willing to compromise and the coming war will see entire worlds decimated for it.<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But way out on the fringes of colonized space. On a lonely moon called Frontiers Reach. Captain Anya Zuban and First Mate Rhen Malavik are prepping their vessel, the Heliosiren, to lead a group of survivors deep into uncharted space to escape the coming war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose your loadout</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each fighter in your hangar performs different duties but you are not restricted from choosing any of them. Pick the one you want and customize numerous aspects of it. From the color of the paint to the different types of modules and weapons that can be equipped.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1467590/extras/b866375da0c153141841f70fc73e8024.avif?t=1780047455\" width=600 height=336 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1467590/extras/c87d05c93045c0cd3e96ec285e4d03ec.avif?t=1780047455\" width=600 height=336 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Join the war effort and fight for control over the frontier</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With more than 30 different locations in space and on planets there is a wide diversity of environments to run missions in. Whether you're fighting battles to win over planets, running skirmishes on friendly nodes, or rescuing vessels in distress to add to your fleet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1467590/extras/ad758d3fc5b17bd6b12f63de5cb2e526.avif?t=1780047455\" width=600 height=336 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Art and World Building like no other</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A military science fiction fantasy based on reality; Frontiers Reach takes heavy inspiration from the Cold War Era of the real world to create a brand new realm in the genres of science fiction and space games. A heavily stylized art direction that focuses on capturing the magic of Atompunk, Cassette Futurism, and Retro-futurist art styles from the mid 20th century. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1467590/extras/fbc582db24051bc883673198a2f3c330.avif?t=1780047455\" width=600 height=336 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1467590/extras/c856f2ee404d0b41f10ae7ebb47554bb.avif?t=1780047455\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1467590/extras/d53a410d9cce114cdb9a4e425e70d299.avif?t=1780047455\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This game uses AI generated content in the following ways.  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some 2D character art.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 pieces of music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main narrative voice which is about 2 hours of dialogue generated with Microsoft Azure Neuro-Voice, an AI playing the role of an AI.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Take control of a powerful starfighter and enter a conflict stretching across the frontier. Tackle story missions, side operations, and high-stakes combat scenarios as you battle enemy forces, support the war effort, and adapt your ship to each mission. With customizable loadouts and fast-paced space battles that change the shape of the conflict, every mission gives you another chance to prove yourself among the stars.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1467590/extras/31b02bc8b2b32add7aff2c80abc236d3.avif?t=1780047455\" width=600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An epic story of survival in an interstellar war</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is the year 2230. After nearly 100 years of expansion and colonization in space, the human species now stands on the brink of war. On one side is the corrupt and aging Sol Confederacy. On the other is the fledgling, Frontier Republic. <br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Neither one is willing to compromise and the coming war will see entire worlds decimated for it.<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But way out on the fringes of colonized space. On a lonely moon called Frontiers Reach. Captain Anya Zuban and First Mate Rhen Malavik are prepping their vessel, the Heliosiren, to lead a group of survivors deep into uncharted space to escape the coming war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose your loadout</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each fighter in your hangar performs different duties but you are not restricted from choosing any of them. Pick the one you want and customize numerous aspects of it. From the color of the paint to the different types of modules and weapons that can be equipped.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1467590/extras/b866375da0c153141841f70fc73e8024.avif?t=1780047455\" width=600 height=336 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1467590/extras/c87d05c93045c0cd3e96ec285e4d03ec.avif?t=1780047455\" width=600 height=336 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Join the war effort and fight for control over the frontier</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With more than 30 different locations in space and on planets there is a wide diversity of environments to run missions in. Whether you're fighting battles to win over planets, running skirmishes on friendly nodes, or rescuing vessels in distress to add to your fleet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1467590/extras/ad758d3fc5b17bd6b12f63de5cb2e526.avif?t=1780047455\" width=600 height=336 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Art and World Building like no other</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A military science fiction fantasy based on reality; Frontiers Reach takes heavy inspiration from the Cold War Era of the real world to create a brand new realm in the genres of science fiction and space games. A heavily stylized art direction that focuses on capturing the magic of Atompunk, Cassette Futurism, and Retro-futurist art styles from the mid 20th century. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1467590/extras/fbc582db24051bc883673198a2f3c330.avif?t=1780047455\" width=600 height=336 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1467590/extras/c856f2ee404d0b41f10ae7ebb47554bb.avif?t=1780047455\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1467590/extras/d53a410d9cce114cdb9a4e425e70d299.avif?t=1780047455\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This game uses AI generated content in the following ways.  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some 2D character art.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 pieces of music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main narrative voice which is about 2 hours of dialogue generated with Microsoft Azure Neuro-Voice, an AI playing the role of an AI.</p>", "short_description": "Pilot a starfighter in Frontiers Reach. Fight through an interstellar war and customize your way through a retro-futuristic space combat campaign.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“There was a moment that it just clicked and I was hooked.”<br>Ryshok - Twitch Streamer<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1467590/header.jpg?t=1780047455", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1467590/dab1db35cea6c766eaa252f24ef6a6e52448aee4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1780047455", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1467590/dab1db35cea6c766eaa252f24ef6a6e52448aee4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1780047455", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 6 core Intel or AMD @ 3.5 GHz or higher<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 12 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Geforce GTX 1600 series or later, AMD Radeon HD 7700 or later.<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 20 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Integrated or better</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 8 core Intel or AMD @ 4.0 GHz or higher<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Geforce GTX 1600 series or later, AMD Radeon HD 7700 or later.<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 20 GB 